{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113466918124347393", "3_2113466942962966528"]}, "author_id": "39125788", "created_at": "2026-10-23T03:06:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113466978035749097"], "id": "2113466978035749097", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 81, "impression_count": 29097, "like_count": 282, "quote_count": 8, "reply_count": 83, "retweet_count": 38}, "text": "We don't have a lot of evidence, but the bulk  of the academic papers modelling the dynamic seem to suggest AI initially helps attackers more than defenders because of the low marginal cost of attacks in the short term. https://t.co/zCsw9Qt9u5", "url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2113466978035749097"}, {"author_id": "1214528593", "created_at": "2026-10-23T02:48:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113462570028011706"], "id": "2113462570028011706", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2136, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113442569313202404", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I mean yeah it kind of is https://t.co/FWv2MPI9gF", "url": "https://x.com/Miles_Brundage/status/2113462570028011706"}, {"author_id": "279036722", "created_at": "2026-10-23T01:34:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113443962468114705"], "id": "2113443962468114705", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 51, "impression_count": 59371, "like_count": 1064, "quote_count": 15, "reply_count": 81, "retweet_count": 62}, "text": "You can debate the magnitude of people who move for tax reasons. But if you debate the existence you lose all credibility with me. I could easily name more than a dozen people I know who have moved from high-tax jurisdictions to low-tax jurisdictions to reduce their taxes.", "url": "https://x.com/jasonfurman/status/2113443962468114705"}, {"author_id": "1214528593", "created_at": "2026-10-23T01:03:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113436149180154073"], "id": "2113436149180154073", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2599, "like_count": 28, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 8, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Particle Man has absolutely no right to be such a banger", "url": "https://x.com/Miles_Brundage/status/2113436149180154073"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113291506534518785"]}, "author_id": "612896910", "created_at": "2026-10-22T23:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113412587224527259"], "id": "2113412587224527259", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2333, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Import air passenger fares increased 11.8 percent for the year ended September 2026 #BLSData https://t.co/Tg5ZJLXplz https://t.co/dsQjwi8ZnC", "url": "https://x.com/BLS_gov/status/2113412587224527259"}, {"author_id": "1214528593", "created_at": "2026-10-22T23:04:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113406071540977845"], "id": "2113406071540977845", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 4950, "like_count": 52, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "Lots of very sharp folks seem to have joined Theorem lately\n\nNot surprising if you've met @rajashree but still cool to see!", "url": "https://x.com/Miles_Brundage/status/2113406071540977845"}, {"author_id": "1214528593", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:57:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113404453152084284"], "id": "2113404453152084284", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2795, "like_count": 17, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112495531947901003", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is literally me when I lie down in bed + our two elderly cats come over to sit/stand on me and it's great  https://t.co/KI93zYx7XH", "url": "https://x.com/Miles_Brundage/status/2113404453152084284"}, {"author_id": "279036722", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:42:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113400578592420078"], "id": "2113400578592420078", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 20, "impression_count": 24010, "like_count": 157, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 26, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "One thought no one will like on the CA wealth tax (and also on high-income taxes in other states): To some degree as a quasi-utilitarian I should be thinking about what it does to total revenue not state revenue. If CA loses 80 but Texas and Florida gain 100 that could be good.", "url": "https://x.com/jasonfurman/status/2113400578592420078"}, {"author_id": "1214528593", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:40:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113400196805882148"], "id": "2113400196805882148", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 2892, "like_count": 24, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112966949273801086", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "OpenAI's public benefit report should be due soon, too, right? https://t.co/kw0aD53Owv", "url": "https://x.com/Miles_Brundage/status/2113400196805882148"}, {"author_id": "59603406", "created_at": "2026-10-22T22:01:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113390420923441663"], "id": "2113390420923441663", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 272, "impression_count": 246349, "like_count": 2106, "quote_count": 65, "reply_count": 79, "retweet_count": 325}, "text": "Thursday's 10-year Treasury yield decline of 0.193 percentage point (to 4.952%) is the largest single day yield decline since March 10, 2023, which is the day Silicon Valley Bank failed.", "url": "https://x.com/NickTimiraos/status/2113390420923441663"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113378381974659073"]}, "author_id": "332617373", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:14:12.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113378412677280255"], "id": "2113378412677280255", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 7, "impression_count": 25054, "like_count": 102, "quote_count": 34, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "Posted earlier:\n\nFYI, my FT column on \"our yields, your problem\" -- Why Europe should not wait for lower US bond yields.\n\nhttps://t.co/llFDRQPt0B\n\n#economy #markets #bonds #yields #europe @FT https://t.co/5xvopY9SEY", "url": "https://x.com/elerianm/status/2113378412677280255"}, {"author_id": "26538229", "created_at": "2026-10-22T20:31:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113367658972303853"], "id": "2113367658972303853", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 48844, "like_count": 32, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 5}, "text": "Our weekly #BalanceSheet update: https://t.co/LjSvhf5K21 #FedData", "url": "https://x.com/federalreserve/status/2113367658972303853"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113361247785644032"]}, "author_id": "39125788", "created_at": "2026-10-22T20:06:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113361252173091114"], "id": "2113361252173091114", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 753, "impression_count": 59019, "like_count": 803, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 63, "retweet_count": 43}, "text": "Very useful prompt for Codex with computer use. https://t.co/tOCwIo3JOy", "url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2113361252173091114"}, {"author_id": "1214528593", "created_at": "2026-10-22T20:05:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113361013571719348"], "id": "2113361013571719348", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2390, "like_count": 21, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "RIP Tom Skerritt aka (to me) DavidDrumlin in Contact", "url": "https://x.com/Miles_Brundage/status/2113361013571719348"}, {"author_id": "1214528593", "created_at": "2026-10-22T18:49:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113342097063661670"], "id": "2113342097063661670", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 9, "impression_count": 4853, "like_count": 117, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 11, "retweet_count": 12}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113290966933389390", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Folks are commenting on issues with the terms, and they exist, but perspective is important:\n\nMETR gets the best terms they can, others often get worse terms than them, and most companies have done 0 embedding.\n\nWe need binding standards for this stuff, not ad hoc bargaining https://t.co/iMU3HHYR9S", "url": "https://x.com/Miles_Brundage/status/2113342097063661670"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113341002228383744"]}, "author_id": "332617373", "created_at": "2026-10-22T18:45:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113341011074183506"], "id": "2113341011074183506", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 65, "impression_count": 63123, "like_count": 718, "quote_count": 18, "reply_count": 72, "retweet_count": 143}, "text": "It’s a classic safe-haven day in the US Treasury market—and we haven't seen one in quite a while!\nTech jitters are driving a flight to quality, sending yields tumbling (please see the Bloomberg chart of the 10 year yield).\nMeanwhile, higher oil prices are feeding growth fears https://t.co/tYMbprkAwb", "url": "https://x.com/elerianm/status/2113341011074183506"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113338603963125760"]}, "author_id": "321536046", "created_at": "2026-10-22T18:36:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113338614104908013"], "id": "2113338614104908013", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 839, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "We’re hiring! For these positions: \n\nIT Specialist (Policy and Planning)\nhttps://t.co/curzbIOLJc\n \nIT Specialist (OS)\nhttps://t.co/ANQTYXEDRV https://t.co/MRBSGYSzJw", "url": "https://x.com/BEA_News/status/2113338614104908013"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113323639214899200"]}, "author_id": "39125788", "created_at": "2026-10-22T17:36:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113323645284344215"], "id": "2113323645284344215", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 231, "impression_count": 48767, "like_count": 756, "quote_count": 36, "reply_count": 145, "retweet_count": 85}, "text": "When my first AI book was published in 2024, the best AI could do 4 minutes of human work with a 50% chance of success\n\nWhen I turned in the draft of Co-Existence earlier this year, it was 17 hours\n\nWhen it was published two days ago, AI could do 17 weeks https://t.co/ON0qKpJ6LD https://t.co/d97kFWQ3B4", "url": "https://x.com/emollick/status/2113323645284344215"}, {"author_id": "1214528593", "created_at": "2026-10-22T16:43:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113310359310455217"], "id": "2113310359310455217", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 2436, "like_count": 27, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113294513930186977", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Myfos by Anfropic \n\nCEVons paradox https://t.co/2QQAf3o0Bm", "url": "https://x.com/Miles_Brundage/status/2113310359310455217"}, {"author_id": "1214528593", "created_at": "2026-10-22T16:39:23.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113309250546229248"], "id": "2113309250546229248", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3237, "like_count": 61, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 5}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113292621854527628", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This kind of thing is a big part of why we don’t have more AI talent in government, moreso than salaries (though they should be higher, too) https://t.co/cAHRUsMl9w", "url": "https://x.com/Miles_Brundage/status/2113309250546229248"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113290307634647040"]}, "author_id": "612896910", "created_at": "2026-10-22T15:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113291791302623705"], "id": "2113291791302623705", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2347, "like_count": 8, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "Import air passenger fares increased 11.8 percent for the year ended September 2026 #BLSData htt